+    """Loop 13: (low, high, counting word) of a numbered name, the one reading of a name's bounds (interval_forms
+    reads an interval's the same way, _INTERVAL): '20-24세' -> (20, 24, '세'), '5인' -> (5, 5, '인'), '85세 이상' ->
+    (85, inf, '세'), '15세미만' -> (-inf, 14, '세'), '65' -> (65, 65, ''). None for any other name."""
